Subject: Build for the Switch with the NVK driver

Upstream-base: 1155e0ed531126f33a1279afa029349651ca1c93

new-coke/dawn-switch 8d6453c8 ("Build fixes and NVK workarounds") without its
dependency fetcher change, and with Dawn's Abseil patch (patches/abseil-cpp.patch)
and dawn-switch's addition to it applied to Abseil here: with DAWN_PLATFORM_SWITCH,
Dawn would otherwise patch the prepared Abseil while configuring, and it only
checks a patch already applied. All changes are limited to the Switch.

